{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eef01c00bc37e2cb1913c54d3bc256829fa4258a0634346a6b98e1e8ad0bacc0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:beb7bbbdba55f0c89ce72df577b95c9d1879b35482e9266522bd421e3ccc14e2",
      "text": "小小聚餐会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d59dab2d5d0afdf68e54287ded051298946094f3511c81104ad4f0d3e4999d62",
      "text": "某天的碰头会前。克里斯找想乐和\n制作人商量，雨彦生日时要不要办点什么。\n面对询问具体想做什么的想乐，克里斯提议\n举办一场小小的派对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:674499143fbe3f608aa15cc9210d82f0e280b75d192976461159d4037fb33938",
      "text": "辛苦啦～。哎？已经到了啊～。\n比约好的时间要早不少吧～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f6863f45126755644aa5ea0fdaec9c6fbb402139ef4f60fe4126f1655d8f071",
      "text": "我太期待雨彦的生日会了，\n干劲十足地就赶过来了！想乐呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49458ae92589cf9f4a3c2a1cb705bdd800392f925a6e23a37e041b99f5eb1693",
      "text": "我是找制作人有事，\n为了把事情办完才早来的哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a07c26a5acf5c988903dbbcbbc8551bb491992fe86a594dcff3f016325c206d",
      "text": "原来是这样。离雨彦过来还有一段时间，\n今天一定要度过美好的一天！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14f4cf23b650123fc9d856bd01572795458ca01d19d0f02f8f208e4fe8be88ce",
      "text": "是呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e379c36b988fb7b545a401f6f40273e91a0d4d4447915e91ddbab47cc389d3ac",
      "text": "雨彦先生的生日正好在万圣节当天，\n很有雨彦先生的风格呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e07a751407e030c0ba7e4d2c3c3fddeefb785fb6738c5723751ba6228f719187",
      "text": "嚯，是从哪方面\n这么觉得的，说给我听听看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13b1b026c0da5cbc8ab8ba82748d10d2b15aa145300d6de9a475546e388c64a9",
      "text": "就是这种地方吧～。\n你自己不也是心知肚明的嘛～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:860ddb43c43e948ad48323142065bb8daa507ba97abec683baeef1441446064a",
      "text": "原来如此。观察得很仔细嘛。为了不露出马脚，\n今后我也得小心行事才行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c529078ea4f05c93263fd8c1ff3ef308ae4073a75e4df3d49a28cec191d6a86",
      "text": "真是的，就是这种地方啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e88d70f17c2c29533dc2990e040bc08d7567543e2d1d0baed8d86ed9555d2854",
      "text": "在你挑的那家店里吃到的菜，\n每一样都很好吃啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b4c0de38c13178d63fb3cac0d0d8954bb90319fd922fb3467c9535e53d81634",
      "text": "因为很想让雨彦品尝到当季的海鲜，\n听到您这么说我真高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ef3910778a9e97cd4a302716d439126b952ed5c04112a8e58b16d7dcd972e70",
      "text": "不仅是味道，店里的氛围也很好。\n带我去了个好地方，谢谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bab97da381d4ec6fdb8cc310d87bc2a47cc1612818a0e430dc631f9c732ad661",
      "text": "我还有其他想推荐给您的菜品。\n什么时候我们再去一次吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cbdb7bc33c9a2913508beb85062d66b4b2f0a39e90c81f404f865e8affe5397",
      "text": "啊啊，好啊。\n下次叫上制作人和北村一起去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
